.Dd January 20, 2026
.Dt XDG-DESKTOP-PORTAL-SCHEMER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm xdg-desktop-portal-schemer
.Nd An xdg-desktop-portal backend for color scheme scheduling
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl hrvV
.Op Fl c Ar FILE
.Op Fl \-dump-schedule
.Op Fl \-replace
.Op Fl \-version
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
program provides a minimal implementation of the Setting portal
interface for an XDG Desktop Portal implementation, specifically for
the desktop color-scheme.
.Pp
When run without a configuration file,
.Nm
will simply provide the value of the color-scheme key in the
.Xr gsettings 1
org.gnome.desktop.interface schema. A configuration file may optionally be used 


.Pp
The
.Nm
program is configured via the
.Xr xdg-desktop-portal-schemer.conf 5
file.
The default configuration file location may be overriden with the
.Fl c
or
.Fl \-conf
options.
.Nm
re-reads its configuration file when a
.Dv SIGHUP
signal is recieved.
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Xo Fl c Ar FILE
.Fl \-conf Ar FILE
.Xc
Specify an alternate path to the configuration file.
.It Fl h
Output a usage message and exit.
.It Fl \-dump-schedule
Output the color scheme schedule for the current year and exit.
.It Fl r Fl \-replace
Replace and existing instance of
.Nm .
.It Fl v Fl \-version
Enable extra debugging messages to standard error.
.It Fl V Fl \-version
Output the version number of
.Nm
and exit.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width XDG_CONFIG_HOME
.It Ev DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS
the address used to connect to the
.Xr dbus-daemon 1 .
.It Ev HOME
used to locate the configuration and lock files if the XDG variables
are not set.
.It Ev XDG_CACHE_HOME
if set, the lock file will be created in this directory.
.It Ev XDG_CONFIG_HOME
if set, the default configuration file should be located here.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/xdg-desktop-portal-schemer.conf
default configuration file location if the
.Fl c
or
.Fl \-conf
options are not used.
If the
.Ev XDG_CONFIG_HOME
environment variable is not set then the file should be located in the
.Pa $HOME/.config/
directory.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr xdg-desktop-portal-schemer.conf 5 ,
.Xr portals.conf 5 ,
.Xr color-scheme-watcher 1 ,
.Lk https://flatpak.github.io/xdg-desktop-portal/ ,
.Lk https://flatpak.github.io/xdg-desktop-portal/docs/doc-org.freedesktop.portal.Settings.html
.Sh AUTHORS
The
.Nm
program was written by
